---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Zhichao Li, aka b1tank: software engineer, visual thinker, and builder.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">A little context</span>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lede">I’m Zhichao Li, aka b1tank. I build Visual Studio Code and GitHub Copilot at Microsoft.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="shell about-grid">
    <aside class="about-aside">
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Now</dt><dd>Developer tools and AI</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Before</dt><dd>Data science and cloud</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Foundation</dt><dd>Ph.D. in chemical engineering</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Outside work</dt><dd>Basketball and billiards</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Seattle, WA</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>My path into software started in the physical world. As a chemical engineer, I worked with systems you could see and touch: equipment, flows, measurements, and processes. I later moved through data science and cloud engineering into the developer tools I work on today.</p>
      <p>That background shapes how I learn and explain technology. Digital systems are built from layers of abstraction, and I often understand them by drawing the system, finding a physical analogy, or building a small version myself.</p>
      <h2>What this site is for</h2>
      <p>This is my durable place for technical notes, visual explanations, longer thoughts, and projects. Some writing will be polished; some will simply capture a useful idea before it disappears.</p>
      <p>I care about software that respects the person using it: clear purpose, thoughtful defaults, and as little accidental complexity as possible.</p>
      <h2>Away from the keyboard</h2>
      <p>I’m a basketball fan and amateur player, with a predictable appreciation for Stephen Curry. I also enjoy billiards and pool. Both reward repetition, feel, and staying humble when a good streak inevitably ends.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email me at <code>{'b1tank${StephenCurry.jerseyNumber}@gmail.com'}</code>. Replace the expression with Steph’s jersey number.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
